ing and  far from home no way home is the third  spider-man movie with tom holland the  plot follows on directly from its  forerunner and presents the superhero  and his entire entourage with a major  challenge as mysterio uncovered  spider-man's identity at the end of the  second part and is closed into the world  peter parker who is actually concerned  about his anonymity cannot cope at all  with the unexpected fame he's  particularly burdened by the  disadvantages that his friends and  family suffer because of him and so he  decides to ask his co-avenger doctor  strange for advice after a failed spell  the world is even more upside down than  before because now several universes  have emerged which in addition to all  the villains of the spidey films from  the 2000s and 2010s also brings the  respective spider-man of dumb hull and  toby maguire and andrew garfield  together during the epic finale it  becomes clear that doctor strange can no  longer control the many rifts in the  multiverse which is why peter makes the  decision to cast a second spell this  time really no one is supposed to  remember peter parker including strange  himself and of course spidey's family  and friends unlike the beginning of the  movie peter is now willing to sacrifice  all that to save the world from the  collapse of the multiverse in the end we  get to see peter being accepted into the  famous mit and visiting his aunt's grave  last but not least the friendly  neighborhood spider swings through the  urban canyons of new york in a homemade  suit and goes on another manhunt in the  mid-credits scene eddie brogan is  symbiote as seen sitting at a bar  they've been sent back to the original  world by strange spell though a small  part of the symbiote remains on the  counter  now turn our attention to the theories  about the upcoming spider-man 4. first  of all it's not clear yet which  direction the new trilogy will take but  it seems that all signs point to a new  start the whole world has forgotten that  peter parker's spider-man so far now  spidey is free to go on a manhunt  undisturbed and come to terms with what  has happened especially the loss of his  aunt may was very traumatic for him in  addition he must cope with the fact that  his friends do not recognize him anymore  when he finally visits mj and ned at the  end of nowhere home and sees how  wonderful and peaceful their lives are  without him he decides not to reveal his  identity however we cannot imagine that  the story of peter parker will be  completely revisited instead we will  probably see a torrent spider-man who  has to consider every time and knew how  to deal with the situation on the one  hand he may be the righteous superhero  but on the other hand peter parker is  still a human being and he definitely  wants his longtime friend ned and his  girlfriend mj back  first let's begin with a very gloomy  theory but one that is not entirely  impossible in one scene ned asks toby  maguire spider-man whether he also has a  best friend to which he replies that his  best friend harry turned into a villain  and ended up dying in his arms what  might have provided fans of the first  spiderman trilogy with a few harmless  laughs could on closer inspection  actually be a hint at the new trilogy  true that does later empathically tell  peter that he will never turn evil  however even if that doesn't really fit  to spider-man 4 we could still be in for  a surprise  in part 5 or 6. another clue to this is  the plot in the comics there ned was  originally a co-worker of peter's at the  daily bugle and is later manipulated by  a villain named hobgoblin into  eventually sacrificing himself for him  so figuratively speaking ned dies just  as harry did in the arms of his best  friend in spite of some clues to this  fate we cannot believe that the popular  supporting character would undergo such  a change all the more so since he is  peter's best friend and not his work  colleague as in the comics  many fans have been expecting miles  morales to appear in some form alongside  peter parker for a long time the two  sony video games about their respective  superheroes have already shown that this  works wonderfully and they do would  certainly look great on the big screen  as well for many the appearance of  live-action miles is the next logical  step after all the multiverse is already  being further expanded with doctor  strange and the multiverse of madness  finally peter could hand over the reigns  to miles in part 506 and entrust his  protege with a day-to-day business in  new york city an indicator for this  could be a statement of tom holland from  last november at the time he said he  would be doing something wrong if he was  still playing the role of spider-man at  the age of 30. he would be depraving a  younger successor of the opportunity of  following his footsteps he also did not  rule out a female character either  however a continuation of the story of a  mouse is much more likely because it is  completely unclear what will happen to  him after spider-man and new universe  too  of course it's not quite clear yet who  will be the main villain of spider-man 4  but we already have an idea as already  mentioned we see eddie brock sitting at  a bar at the end of nowhere home leaving  a small part of his symbiote behind many  fans were very excited about the scene  after a reunion of spidey and venom-like  in spider-man 3 with toby maguire is the  great dream of moviegoers interestingly  artist thomas de crest recently  published a couple of concept images of  tom holland in a symbiote suit on  twitter the concept artist clarified  that this was not planned for no way  home but it could be an approach for  spider-man 4. for this to be realistic  the symbiote would have to somehow find  its way to new york city to its new host  in fact we assume that venom and  spider-man will meet soon but well that  will already be the case in spider-man 4  is still up in the air  our final theory concerns peter's  academic future he could be accepted at  the massachusetts institute of  technology or mit for short just like  mjnet this storyline would involve a  change of location because the world  famous university is not located in new  york but in boston almost 350 kilometers  away the mit is so interesting because  another upcoming mcu heroine also  studies there namely ironheart who in  turn is the dedicated successor of  ironman who died in avengers endgame not  only could a rather complicated  friendship develop between the two due  to peter's emotional connection to his  mentor tony stark but an appearance by  iron hot would also fit wonderfully into  the mcu time-wise the character of riri  williams as the superheroine's real name  is is getting her own series on disney  plus anyway and who knows maybe the  blood of the series will fit in  beautifully with an upcoming spider-man  4.  well that's it for today's original what  are your thoughts on our theories about  the upcoming spider-man 4. can you agree  with our assessment or do you have other  perhaps more unusual theories see you  next time  [Music]

